  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ogochia komenya amo n’Abafilisti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akarengereria ase enkoro yaye, akabora: “Rituko erimo ning’itwe na Saulo. Egento kerabe ekiya mono ase ’nde nogotama korwa aiga na kogenda ase ense y’Abafilisti. Erio nario Saulo ararusie moyo, tana kondigia naende aa ase chingongo chi’Abaisraeli, na nintooreke korwa ase okoboko kwaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Daudi akaimoka amo n’baanto baye amagana atano na rimo, akagenda ase Akisi, mosinto o Maoki, omorwoti o Gati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi amo n’baanto baye bakamenya amo n’Akisi agwo Gati. Kera omonto nigo amenyete amo n’baanto b’eamate yaye, na Daudi amo nabakungu baye babere, Ahinoamu korwa Yesireeli, na Abigaeli korwa Karimeli, oyio Nabali atigete ore omoboraka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Saulo ateebetigwe ng’a Daudi konya otamire gochia Gati, tagendete komorigia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Daudi agateebia Akisi: “Onye nanyorire ogwancherwa ase obosio bwao, koranche ong’e aase nkomenya ase omochie ore isiko korwa ase omochie oo. Tari buya ase ’nde, omosomba oo, ngenderere komenya ase omochie omonene bw’oborwoti amo naye?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, ase rituko riria Akisi akaa Daudi Sikilagi. Ase engencho eyio omochie oyio o Sikilagi nigo ore oyo bw’abarwoti b’Abayuda goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akagenderera komenya ase ense y’Abafilisti ase engaki y’omwaka oyomo na emetienyi ene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio Daudi na abanto baye bakaba bakogenda korwania Abagesuri, na Abagirisi, na Abaameleki. Abwo nigo baarenge ababiare b’ense eyio korwa kare; nigo bamenyete goika Suri na goika orobebe rw’ense ya Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akaba okorwania ense eyio na goita Abanto bonsi pi, abasacha na abakungu; agasakora ching’ondi, ne chiombe, ne chitigere, ne chingamia, akaira ne chianga. Erio aba okoirana gochia ase Akisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Akisi areenge koboria Daudi: “Insemo ki gwachiete korwania rituko ria reero?” Daudi aba okomoiraneria: “Ense ya Irianyi ere ey’Abayuda,” gose “Ense ya Irianyi ere eya Yerameeli,” gose “Ense ya Irianyi ere ey’Abakeni,”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi tareenge gotiga nonya nomonto oyomo, omosacha gose omokungu, ore moyo, ekiagera nigo areengereretie ng’a onde tabaisa kogenda Gati ateebe ng’a: “Aya naro Daudi agotokorera.” Naboigo yareenge engencho ya Daudi ekero agendererete komenya ase ense y’Abafilisti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Akisi akwegena Daudi mono, akarengereria: “Bono Daudi okorire Abaisraeli bamwabo bamogeche kegima; ase igo agenderere koba omosomba one botaambe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
